{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2mc655hd","type":"work","title":"五方母音","authors":[{"name":"樊騰鳳","role":"撰","dynasty":"清","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bjl9"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《五方母音》•二卷","author_info":"國朝樊騰鳳撰","summary":"國朝樊騰鳳撰。騰鳳字淩虛，堯山人。是書論切字之法，以陰平、陽平析四聲為五，猶屬舊例。其部分則並為二十：曰《一天》、《二人》、《三龍》、《四羊》、《五牛》、《六獒》、《七虎》、《八駝》、《九蛇》、《十馬》、《十一豺》、《十二地》。字母則並為十二：曰梆、匏、木、風，鬥、土、鳥、雷，竹、蟲、石、日，剪、鵲、系、雲，金、橋、火、蛙。皆純用方音，不究古義。如《覃》、《鹽》、《鹹》之併入天，《庚》、《青》、《蒸》之併入龍，其變亂韻部，又甚於《洪武正韻》矣。","edition":"浙江巡撫采進本"}],"juan_count":{"number":2},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-qingxuantongshiyinbe","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/NGJ892312002104803312865","metadata":{"edition":"清宣統2年石印本","version":"v2","total_page":174,"paragraph_count":1165,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-qingguangxukeben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/NGJ892312002104802312658","metadata":{"edition":"清光緒32年刻本","version":"v1","total_page":568,"paragraph_count":2251,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-qingguangxukeben-1","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/NGJ892312002104801312657","metadata":{"edition":"清光緒17年刻本","version":"v1","total_page":288,"paragraph_count":2270,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NCPSSD-70017234_%E4%BA%94%E6%96%B9%E6%AF%8D%E9%9F%B3%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%B7_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%86%8C.pdf"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":2}],"measure_info":"二卷","updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:40:18+00:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period":"qing","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「清」","dynasty":"清","dynasty_basis":"qing_round1:period=qing 且非通用作者 dynasty 唯一为「清」","description":{"text":"樊騰鳳（清）撰。二卷。見著錄於《欽定四庫全書總目》。本書惟《欽定四庫全書總目》一志著錄，別無他證。經注之屬。《欽定四庫全書總目》清乾隆間館臣修——本書之目賴之以存。","sources":["欽定四庫全書總目"]},"ai_note":"2026-08-24 J11 description 撮自本條所繫之著錄：本欄之文由撰人、卷數、著錄諸志、志按所稱之佚文出處與輯家、存佚五節綴